          "items": [
            "Sea D’Light in Watersound West is an inviting and beautifully appointed beach home just moments from the sugar-white sands and turquoise waters of Northwest Florida’s 30A coastline — perfect for family vacations, multi-family getaways, or a memorable beach escape. <br><br>🏡 Property Overview<br>This spacious 3-bedroom + bunk area, 3.5-bath beach retreat comfortably sleeps up to 10 guests, blending coastal charm with modern comfort. Designed with relaxed beach living in mind, Sea D’Light features bright open living spaces, elegant finishes throughout, and versatile sleeping layouts — ideal for kids, adults, and mixed-group stays. And the patio living space and food prep area is the \"chef's kiss\" in this 30A delight. <br><br>🛏 Sleeping Arrangements<br>Primary: King Bed<br>Guest Bedroom 1: Queen Bed<br>Guest Bedroom 2: Queen Bed<br>Bunk Area: 2 Twin-over-Twin Bunk Beds <br><br>🍽 Modern Kitchen & Living Spaces<br>Enjoy a fully equipped kitchen with stainless appliances, generous island seating, and an open layout perfect for family meals or coastal entertaining. Relax in a comfortable living room with thoughtful touches throughout that evoke seaside ease. <br><br>🌴 Outdoor Enjoyment & Community Perks<br>- Screened porch — unwind with morning coffee or evening breeze<br>- Watersound West Beach community — known for its peaceful atmosphere<br>- Zero-entry community pool, scenic fitness trails, and boardwalks<br>- Four complimentary bikes — explore the neighborhood with ease <br><br>Step outside and take a short walk or bike ride to the private beach boardwalk where emerald-green Gulf waters await. <br><br>🌟 Why Guests Love Sea D’Light<br>Sea D’Light combines the best of 30A beach living — proximity to pristine beaches, exceptional vacation comfort, and community amenities that elevate every moment of your stay. Whether you’re chasing sunsets, sandy strolls, or family fun, this retreat delivers on every front. <br><br>📍 Prime Location: Watersound West Beach<br>Located along scenic 30A, Sea D’Light puts you within minutes of world-class dining, boutique shopping, coastal bike trails, and nature experiences. It’s a perfect base for exploring the beaches of Santa Rosa Beach, Grayton Beach, and the vibrant communities of Seaside and Rosemary Beach.<br><br>🔑 Features & Amenities<br>- Sleeps 10 with flexible bedding options <br>- Fully equipped kitchen & open living layout <br>- Screened porch with outdoor seating <br>- Zero-entry community pool & scenic trails <br>- Complimentary bikes for guest use <br>- Close access to 30A beaches & coastal attractions <br><br>📅 Perfect For<br>✔ Family beach vacations<br>✔ Multi-family or multi-generation stays<br>✔ Group getaways close to beach access and coastal dining<br>✔ Active travelers who love biking, strolling, and beach days<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS (SLEEPS 10)<br>• Bedroom 1: 1 King Bed<br>• Bedroom 2: 1 Queen Bed<br>• Bedroom 3: 1 Queen Bed<br>• Bunk Area: 2 Twin-over-Twin Bunk Beds<br><br>**Please note that the garage is not available for parking.<br><br>Blue Swell Vacation Rentals is a boutique property management company that specializes in top-of-the-line, luxury beach rentals from PCB, 30A, and Destin. Our loyal guests come back year after year because of the exclusive homes and condos we offer as well as the excellent service we provide. Our keyless entry, premier linens with 300 thread count sheets, plush towels, and high-end starter supplies are just the beginning of the convenient amenities we provide for every guest. Most importantly, Blue Swell’s phone service allows our guests to experience the best vacation ever with less stress. It is always a SWELL day at the beach!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
